---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy · Commandsnippets">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <h2>Click analytics</h2>
  <p>
    Our website and web app use CT, operated by Tearleads, LLC and hosted on
    Cloudflare, to understand which parts of the service people use. CT records
    click times, element types, the application and environment, and public
    website page categories. Web app clicks use a generic page identifier so
    usernames and tag names in routes are not collected.
  </p>
  <p>
    The collector also records the IP address and available approximate location
    information, such as country, region and city. Click records are retained
    for up to 90 days and are available only to authenticated CT administrators.
    We do not send snippet text, form values, link destinations, query strings,
    account identifiers or persistent visitor identifiers with these events.
    Editable fields are excluded from click collection.
  </p>
  <p>
    CT honors the browser's Do Not Track setting and the CT browser extension's
    opt-out. Global Privacy Control does not disable this click collection.
  </p>
</Base>
